  Slug: scholar
  DisplayName: Scholar
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You have a knack for learning and sequestered yourself from the outside
    world to learn all you could. You read about so many wondrous places and things
    in your books, always dreaming about one day seeing the real things. Eventually,
    that curiosity led you to leave your studies and become an adventurer. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in your choice of the Arcana, Nature, Occultism,
    or Religion skill, and gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Assurance]
    skill feat in your chosen skill. You're also trained in the Academia Lore skill.
